{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/986331-best-hedgespinner","id":986331,"title":"Best Hedgespinner","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-12T13:12:08-07:00","id":986331,"title":"Best Hedgespinner","content":"What kith choice would be the best if you wanted your character to be able to be based on something like Vulcan the god. Able to make magical arms and armor but also weird magical contraptions and traps. Artist, Maker, or Smith maybe another one? Im fine with the character taking awhile to build something but I want that something to be the best thing it can be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11277-hyperspacewizard","name":"hyperspacewizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T17:48:59-07:00","id":986494,"title":"","content":"Dual Smith/Maker. Add Wyrd to crafting rolls, gain 8 again to crafting rolls, spend 2 glamour to add Wyrd again to crafting and to turn extended action crafting rolls into instant actions.<br /> <br /> Yeah you have -1 effective Wyrd to your first crafting bonus, and -2 Wyrd to the spend Wyrd bonus to crafting rolls, but they stack you you have a net gain.<br /> <br /> Its a combined crafting bonus of Wyrd 1, that's +2 bonus, at Wyrd 2, its still a +2 bonus, at Wyrd 3, its a +3 bonus, at Wyrd 4 its +5 bonus, at Wyrd 5, its a +7 bonus, at Wyrd 6 its a +9 bonus, at Wyrd 7 its a +11, at Wyrd 8 its a +13 bonus, at Wyrd 9 its a +15 bonus and at Wyrd 10 its a +17 bonus, plus 8 again, instant extended actions.<br /> <br /> Plus some of benifits apply to more then crafting. So its worth it, because one makes up for the penalty of the others so you don't net lose out. They fit together hand in glove.<br /> <br /> At Wyrd 10, you can use that bonus, plus Embracing the Wyrd to have a dice pool of 17 + 10, and if you spend another 13 glamour another 13 dice for 40 bonus crafting dice per turn, on top of your crafting + strength + Wyrd roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 10-12-2016, 08:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T19:27:48-07:00","id":986517,"title":"","content":"Thanks that makes alot of sense. If you took the potent kith merit which one do you think should be the primary kith?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11277-hyperspacewizard","name":"hyperspacewizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T19:44:13-07:00","id":986523,"title":"","content":"Smith, the +Wyrd to craft rolls is always on, where as you have to spend a glamour to get the +wyrd to craft rolls with Maker.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T20:24:56-07:00","id":986541,"title":"","content":"Cool thanks alot!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11277-hyperspacewizard","name":"hyperspacewizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T06:34:49-07:00","id":986720,"title":"","content":"Your very welcome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T11:48:48-07:00","id":986869,"title":"","content":"I'm not actually sure that successes or time are necessarily the stopgaps for hedgespinning. Good Time Management + Brownie's Boon means you are taking anywhere from 1/4 to 1/16 the time, and each roll is only an hour by default. Even a 5 dot token is only 15 successes, which means you want about 60 *total* dice between all of your rolls. That is pretty doable.<br /> <br /> The real challenge for Hedgespinning is aquiring the ingrediants.<br /> <br /> That said,if your question is what best represents making the God Vulcan, then Smith / Maker is excellent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T14:24:10-07:00","id":986952,"title":"","content":"Then maybe a focus on occult and investigation to be better able to research and find the proper materials? Plus you can add the patient merit which gives you 2 extra roles on extended actions past what you normal could do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11277-hyperspacewizard","name":"hyperspacewizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T18:06:21-07:00","id":987019,"title":"","content":"Get someone else to gather the ingredient, Vulcan doesn't do his own mining or cutting down trees for handles, ect... He deligates that to someone else so she can stay by his forge building cool stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T18:44:11-07:00","id":987039,"title":"","content":"True I wonder if I could make a lance has a longer range when throw and causes the the Stun condition by transforming into lighting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11277-hyperspacewizard","name":"hyperspacewizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T04:14:06-07:00","id":987183,"title":"","content":"Sounds like a good token to me. 2 to 3 dots at most.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T08:40:30-07:00","id":987269,"title":"","content":"Im hoping for either a large pool of tokens to look over or some deeper rules on hedgespinning if not in the core then in a supplement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11277-hyperspacewizard","name":"hyperspacewizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T10:53:57-07:00","id":987832,"title":"","content":"I believe the first Supplement for Changeling is called The Hedge, so you will likely get your wish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}